tories of past prophets, and the consequences faced by those who rejected divine guidance. It reminds believers about the importance of faith, patience, and trust in Allah\u2019s wisdom and protection.", "short_description": "Surah Al-Hijr highlights the preservation of the Quran, the stories of past prophets, and the consequences faced by those who rejected divine guidance. It reminds believers about the importance of faith, patience, and trust in Allah\u2019s wisdom and protection."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25736809235990683"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_2006967773587011_3755714966670718990_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TD2rIfHcKygQ7kNvwE2nVpp&_nc_oc=AdrGjWBiXUiCjYMtVDKd4WUOwRjuvH4aheAzhL_gCpcHhJ4EM3zjFE-WJYWaEIVuamE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRaJM3awcv7LpnpE2AOBoNMC2rzkJDJh7N8_ihsvT_WuQ&oe=6B05C894"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial